<NPR>NOTE:  Center rails are not normally required for fencing less than<MET> 1829 millimeter</MET><ENG>
 6 feet</ENG> high.  Edit as required.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide center rail conforming to minimum sizes specified in <RID>FS RR-F-191/3</RID> for each class and grade unless members 
are to be oversized.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
][<SPT><TTL><SUB>Bottom Rail</SUB></TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
